    "description": "Once per turn as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to let one adjacent ally use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Aid_Another\" title=\"Aid Another\">Aid Another</a> Action (as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>) to assist you with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Check\">Skill Check</a>. You must make the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Check\">Skill Check</a> before the end of your turn, or the benefit of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Aid_Another\" title=\"Aid Another\">Aid Another</a> Action is lost.<br><br>An ally that has already used the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Aid_Another\" title=\"Aid Another\">Aid Another</a> Action to assist you since the end of your last turn may not be targeted by this Talent.",
